msgid ""
"Disable the interrupt associated with this ``ExtInt`` object. Useful for "
"software debouncing."
msgstr ""
"Desativa a interrupção associada a este objeto ``ExtInt``\\ . Útil para "
"debouncing por software."

#: ../../library/pyb.ExtInt.rst:101
